---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Blog
description: Blog posts on AI, NLP, and technical topics
permalink: /blog/
---

<p>
  Experiments, math, and paper notes &mdash; working through one question: when an AI says it's
  &ldquo;thinking,&rdquo; what is it actually doing? Follow along via <a href="/feed.xml">RSS</a>.
</p>

<div class="blog-posts">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
  <div class="blog-post">
    <h2 class="blog-post-title">
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
    </h2>

    <div class="blog-post-meta">
      <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
      {% if post.data.tags %}
      <span> | Tags: {{ post.data.tags | join(", ") }}</span>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if post.data.description %}
    <div class="blog-post-excerpt">
      {{ post.data.description }}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <a href="{{ post.url }}">Read more →</a>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  {% if collections.posts.length == 0 %}
  <p>No posts yet. Check back soon!</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
